## Practical Applications & Real-World Use Cases

### 1. Sales & Revenue Tracking

**Business Problem:**
Regional sales managers need real-time visibility into performance against targets

**Solution:**
```
Dashboard Components:

1. KPI Cards (Top Row):
   - Total Sales YTD
   - Total Orders
   - Average Order Value
   - Sales Growth % (vs prior year)
   - Forecast Attainment

2. Visual Analytics:
   Sales Trend Line:
   - X-axis: Month
   - Y-axis: Sales amount
   - Color: Different product lines
   - Reference line: Monthly target
   - Forecast: Next 3 months with CI

   Regional Performance Map:
   - Color intensity: Sales volume
   - Interactive: Click region → drill to detail
   - Hover: Revenue, order count, margin

   Product Performance Matrix:
   - X-axis: Market share (size)
   - Y-axis: Profitability (margin)
   - Bubble size: Revenue
   - Color: Product category
   - Shows which products are cash cows vs growth opportunities

3. Filters:
   - Date range (YTD, specific months)
   - Product category
   - Sales region
   - Sales rep

Actionable Insights:
- Identify underperforming regions (red)
- Track vs monthly quota (reference line)
- See trend direction (slope of line)
- Forecast if trajectory continues
```

**Metrics Used:**
```
SUM([Sales Amount])
SUM([Orders])
AVG([Order Value])
YoY Sales = [Sales YTD Current] / [Sales YTD Prior] - 1

Attainment % = SUM([Sales]) / [Monthly Target]

IF [Attainment %] >= 1.0 THEN "On Target"
ELSE "Below Target"
END
```

