🔑 Diagnosis first: Measure before making changes
🔑 Query vs render: Know where bottleneck is
🔑 Extract over live: When data volume large
🔑 Pre-aggregate: Reduce data before import
🔑 Test thoroughly: Before and after metrics
🔑 Monitor ongoing: Prevent regression

